{"id":427,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"英語イマージョンと徳育で主体性を育む","feature_description":"浦和実業学園中学校では、キャリア教育・徳育・英語イマージョン教育を三本柱に据えています。徳育では挨拶、感謝、親切、素直な反省を「オアシスの精神」として示し、互いを尊重して考え行動する力を育成します。中学校ではネイティブ教員が副担任を務め、日常の連絡や実技科目でも英語に触れる環境を整えています。課題解決や発表の機会も取り入れています。","clubs":[{"id":7921,"name":"チア ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7922,"name":"男女テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7923,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7924,"name":"男女ハンドボールクラブ（HC浦和）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7925,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7926,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7927,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7928,"name":"バドミントン 部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7929,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7930,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7931,"name":"ブラスバンド部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7932,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.urajitsu.ed.jp/jh/schoollife_jh/club_jh/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":